      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 46 · AI Client Communication Hub\nOne inbox webhook for every client channel (email, WhatsApp, chat, forms): AI classifies, drafts replies and routes to the right owner.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/client-comms-hub` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"channel\": \"whatsapp\",\n \"from\": \"+91 98450 00000\",\n \"client\": \"Globex\",\n \"client_email\": \"ops@globex.com\",\n \"message\": \"Our invoices for October look wrong, need this fixed today\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
